This repository contains the open interoperability layer only: the normalized
cellular-record schema, carrier file parsers, generic tabular ingestion,
record validation, evidence hashing and manifest verification, geodesy, and
export utilities.

The analytical system built on top of it — correlation, location estimation,
pattern detection, findings and report generation — is a separate proprietary
work and is not covered by this licence.
